        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To remain a leading manufacturer of highly engineered industrial products, it is important that we continue to attract, develop, and retain exceptional talent across our global enterprise consistent with our culture.",
        "start_character": 17608,
        "end_character": 17824
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate a comprehensive set of business processes, philosophies and operational excellence tools to drive continuous improvement throughout our businesses (collectively, the Crane Business System).",
        "start_character": 1625,
        "end_character": 1825
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "An embedded intellectual capital development process helps ensure that we attract, develop, promote and retain the right talent to drive continuity and repeatable results.",
        "start_character": 2128,
        "end_character": 2299
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Beginning with a core value of integrity, we incorporate “Voice of the Customer” learnings (specific processes designed to capture our customers’ requirements) and a broad range of tools into a disciplined strategy deployment process to continuously improve safety, quality, delivery, cost and growth.",
        "start_character": 1826,
        "end_character": 2127
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are committed to developing our associates personally and professionally by leveraging a structured and disciplined Intellectual Capital (“IC”) process.",
        "start_character": 18685,
        "end_character": 18840
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "As a result, we are subject to various statutes and regulations that apply to companies doing business with the government.",
        "start_character": 15482,
        "end_character": 15605
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "By focusing on accelerating the rate of innovation through R&D investment, we have driven incremental market capture and improved new product sales vitality to support long term profitable growth.",
        "start_character": 12496,
        "end_character": 12692
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "To maintain the strength of our workforce, we consistently assess the current business environment and labor market to refine our compensation and benefits programs and other resources available to our associates.",
        "start_character": 18471,
        "end_character": 18684
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "At Crane, we are strongly committed to the health and safety of our associates and strive to continuously adhere to global regulatory safety requirements and to reduce the incidence and severity of job-related injuries.",
        "start_character": 19400,
        "end_character": 19619
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are also committed to an inclusive and high-performance culture at all levels of the organization, based on trust and respect.",
        "start_character": 19127,
        "end_character": 19256
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are regulated by federal, state and international environmental laws governing our use, transport and disposal of substances and control of emissions.",
        "start_character": 16304,
        "end_character": 16457
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001944013-26-000095",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001944013-26-000095-99b9dff9bbad6dc4",
        "accession_number": "0001944013-26-000095",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We expect these segments to outgrow the overall process market, driven by investment in sustainability and clean energy, aging infrastructure, tightening wastewater regulations and an aging population with a growing demand for healthcare.",
